Package: com.samcejko.tikie
Name: Tikie
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unofficial TikTok viewer for iOS 6 (universal): a vertical feed of public videos from creators you follow, your own local ranking, saved videos and comments. Needs the tikie helper on your own server.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Multimedia
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
